        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tetrafluoroethylene, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tetrafluoroethylene, at plant
Inventory for a chemical. Emission data from PRTR-database.;
CAS number: 9002-84-0; 
Formula: C2F4; 
Synonyms: Fluon, PTFE, Teflon, Ethene, tetrafluoro-, homopolymer, Politef, Tetrafluoroethylene Resin; 
UUID: b2b1b3c4-4243-3501-acbe-746542d04885
Gate to gate inventory for the production, estimation for infrastructure and not including by-products.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chemical processing
Time period: undefined
Production volume: The worldwide production capacity in 1987 for fluoroplastics was ca. 45 000t.
Sampling: Literature, company information, stoichiometric calculations, emission database, assumptions. 
Extrapolations: from one plant
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b2b1b3c4-4243-3501-acbe-746542d04885.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
